   <Row <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BRS-101'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `The board shall accept 28 VDC \xb1 4 VDC input power on connector J2.'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `MoC4'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BVP'>>>>>>
   <Row <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BRS-102'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `The board power consumption shall be less than 12 W.'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `MoC4'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BVP'>>>>>>
   <Row <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BRS-103'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `The input power path shall have reverse polarity protection.'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `MoC1'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `Schematics'>>>>>>
  >
 >
