   <Row <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BRS-201'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `The board shall provide one RS422 maintenance interface on connector J1.'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `MoC4'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BVP'>>>>>>
   <Row <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `BRS-202'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `The RS422 interface shall support 115200 baud.'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `'>>>>> <Cell <CellContent <Para <ParaLine <String `'>>>>>>
